msgstr "Affinity change popups"

msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.SECTION_TELEMETRY"
msgid "本地玩法数据"
msgstr "Local Gameplay Data"

msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.ENABLE_TELEMETRY"
msgid "记录匿名社交遥测"
msgstr "Record anonymous social telemetry"

msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.TELEMETRY_HINT"
msgid "默认关闭。开启后只在本机记录事件频率、关系分布、Mod 压力效果、日程占比与性能耗时；复制人会匿名编号，不记录 API Key、AI 地址或存档正文，也不会自动上传。可在对局内「社交 → 事件日志」导出诊断报告"
msgstr "Off by default. When enabled, the mod records event frequency, relationship distribution, mod stress effects, schedule share and performance timings on this device only. Duplicants use anonymous IDs; API keys, AI endpoints and save contents are excluded, and nothing is uploaded automatically. Export a diagnostic report from Social > Event Log while in a colony."

