msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.PRESET_HINT"
msgid "预设调整争执/吃醋/道歉的概率与代价；「安静」少吵少醋，「戏剧」冲突更密"
msgstr "Presets adjust argument/jealousy/apology odds and costs. Quiet = fewer fights, Drama = denser conflict."

msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.STRESS_SOFT_CAP"
